<title>SPAIN: Repsol mulls 90 bln pta cracker investment.</title>
<headline>Repsol mulls 90 bln pta cracker investment.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish energy group Repsol said on Tuesday it is considering an investment of 90 billion pesetas to build a third cracker at its Tarragona refinery.</p>
<p>The aim is to match chemical production to expected future demand.</p>
<p>&quot;The possible market and demand is under study at the moment,&quot; said a spokesman for Repsol.</p>
<p>This would bring Repsol investment in chemicals to a total of 180 billion pesetas by 2000, the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
